TakeposguardConfigurationOnly=JavaScript/server protection, finalization, recovery, audit and maintenance are available. Validate payments, bank, stock and providers on a staging instance before production.
TakeposguardEnable=Enable payment protection
TakeposguardEnableHelp=Disabled by default. JavaScript now supplies the UUID v4 token, but server finalization is still pending.
TakeposguardLockTimeout=Lock lifetime (seconds)
TakeposguardLockTimeoutHelp=10 to 3600 seconds; default 120. Expiration must never override an active database lock.
TakeposguardHistoryDays=Detailed history retention (days)
TakeposguardHistoryDaysHelp=1 to 3650 days; default 90. Recent attempts and replay protection records must be preserved during cleanup.
TakeposguardDebugLog=Detailed logs
TakeposguardDebugLogHelp=Disabled by default. Future diagnostics will use Dolibarr logs without sensitive payment data.
TakeposguardMissingTokenPolicy=Missing attempt token policy
TakeposguardMissingTokenPolicyHelp=Third-party integrations must send a stable token per attempt. No unprotected compatibility mode is provided.
